<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-NAB sets A$150 mln domestic bond.</title>
<headline>RTRS-NAB sets A$150 mln domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Australian Bank Ltd said it has issued a A$150 million bond in the Australian domestic debt market.  </p>
<p>The bonds pay a coupon of 6.75 percent and mature April 15, 2000.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the bank said the issue was for internal funding requirements in a growing business.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
